---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy (Beta)" description="DealyVIP Beta Privacy Baseline." lang="en">
  <div class="container section" style="max-width: var(--content-width);">
    <h1 class="display-title">Privacy Baseline (Beta)</h1>
    
    <h2 class="section-title">Current Data Model</h2>
    <p class="mb-2">During this beta phase, DealyVIP operates strictly as a static informational website.</p>
    <ul class="mb-4" style="padding-left: 1.5rem;">
      <li class="mb-1">The current beta does not implement user accounts.</li>
      <li class="mb-1">The current beta does not process or implement payments.</li>
      <li class="mb-1">The current beta does not collect data through production contact form submissions on this domain.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="section-title">Future Communication</h2>
    <p class="mb-2">If contact is made through future communication channels (such as external email or updated form endpoints), the applicable data handling and retention model will be fully defined before production launch.</p>
    
    <p class="text-muted" style="margin-top: var(--space-lg); font-size: 0.9rem;">This page serves as an informational privacy baseline for the beta deployment and is not a finalized legal privacy policy.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
